#: ../../../comparison.md:3
msgid ""
"Rotary is Gazebo's rolling release stream, built continuously from the "
"`main` branches of the Gazebo libraries. Because it changes every day, it "
"does not have a fixed feature matrix in the same way as a named release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../comparison.md:8
msgid ""
